     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 845,
       "endIndex": 959,
       "text": "**The Equity is Strong:** A **$1.08M** 4-year grant is in the upper quartile (75th+ percentile) for a Google L6 PM"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 961,
       "endIndex": 1041,
       "text": "Due to front-loading, your **Year 1 and Year 2 compensation will be ~$638,000+**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       2,
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1195,
       "endIndex": 1308,
       "text": "**The Equity Cliff in Years 3\u20134:** In Years 3 and 4, the initial grant drops to 22% ($237.6k) and 12% ($129.6k)"
